questions.text:
A circular hole of 25 mm diameter and depth of 20 mm is machined by EDM process. The
material removal rate (in m[latex]m^{3}[/latex] /min) is expressed as [latex]4\times 10^{4}\mathit{IT}^{-1.23}[/latex] where I=300 A and the melting point of the material, [latex]T=1600^{\circ}C. [/latex] The time (in minutes)
for machining this hole is ________ (correct to two decimal places)
